---
import { appLinks } from '../../data/links';
---
<section class="e-sec" id="colleges" style="padding-top: 0; height: 830px">
  <div class="e-wrap">
    <div style="max-width: 760px">
      <span class="e-kicker">Benefits &amp; use cases</span>
      <h2 class="e-h2">Built for both sides of placement day</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="e-aud">
      <div class="e-card e-hover e-aud-card">
        <span class="e-chip g" style="align-self: flex-start">For students</span>
        <h3>Walk into the drive having already been interviewed — ten times.</h3>
        <div class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Practise on campus Wi-Fi or mobile data, on the phone you already have.</span></div>
        <div class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>Hear the questions before the panel asks them — in Hinglish first, then English.</span></div>
        <div class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>A number you can track, not a vague “good job”.</span></div>
        <div class="e-check"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span>A countdown plan built from your drive date and weakest skill.</span></div>
        <a href={appLinks.signup} class="e-btn-primary" style="align-self: flex-start; margin-top: auto">Start free mock</a>
      </div>
      <div class="e-card e-hover e-aud-card">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center"><span class="e-chip g">For placement cells</span><span class="e-lab">Pilot with 2 colleges</span></div>
        <h3>Run a mock day with one QR code. See your batch’s readiness by evening.</h3>
        <div class="e-dash">
          <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 16px"><span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; color: #F4F7F5">Final year · Batch 2026–27</span><span class="mono" style="font-size: 12.5px; color: #BEF264">[N] mocks taken</span></div>
          <div class="e-brow"><span>Computer</span><span class="e-btrack"><span style="width: 64%"></span></span><span class="mono">64</span></div>
          <div class="e-brow"><span>E&amp;TC</span><span class="e-btrack"><span style="width: 58%"></span></span><span class="mono">58</span></div>
          <div class="e-brow"><span>Mechanical</span><span class="e-btrack"><span style="width: 52%"></span></span><span class="mono">52</span></div>
          <div class="e-brow"><span>Civil</span><span class="e-btrack"><span style="width: 49%"></span></span><span class="mono">49</span></div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px">
          <div class="e-tile"><span class="e-lab">Weakest area</span><b>Confidence &amp; pace</b></div>
          <div class="e-tile"><span class="e-lab">Most common deduction</span><b>No example given</b></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
